gantt
    title Article one to publication
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %d

    section Session start
    Commit plugin to repo (A1)        :a1, 2026-10-05, 1d
    Invite header check (A2)          :a2, 2026-10-05, 1d
    Fix site mail if needed (A3)      :a3, after a2, 1d
    Andy follow-up (A4)               :a4, 2026-10-05, 1d

    section Outreach
    NASS reply window (B2)            :crit, b2, 2026-10-05, 2026-10-17
    Grower replies (B3)               :b3, 2026-10-05, 2026-10-12
    Direct-grower fallback            :b3b, 2026-10-12, 2026-10-16
    Grower slot decision (B4)         :milestone, b4, 2026-10-16, 0d

    section Editorial
    Confirm Emmy timeline (C1)        :c1, 2026-10-05, 1d
    Emmy rewrite (C2)                 :crit, c2, 2026-10-06, 2026-10-15
    Kim approvals (C3)                :c3, 2026-10-05, 2026-10-10
    Verify embed page (C6)            :c6, 2026-10-05, 1d
    Program reviews and dates (C4 C5) :c4, 2026-10-07, 1d
    Chart slot (C7)                   :c7, 2026-10-08, 2d
    Compile source URLs (C8)          :c8, 2026-10-07, 2d
    Insert URLs after Emmy (C8)       :c8b, after c2, 1d
    Fill slots (C9)                   :crit, c9, 2026-10-16, 2026-10-17

    section Photos
    Captions (D1)                     :d1, 2026-10-06, 1d
    Sorrentino direct license (D2)    :d2, 2026-10-05, 2026-10-12
    Buy and swap licensed files (D3)  :d3, 2026-10-13, 2d

    section Layout
    Phone pass (E1)                   :e1, 2026-10-06, 1d
    Print check (E2)                  :e2, 2026-10-06, 1d

    section Pitch and publish
    Send Offrange pitch (F2)          :milestone, f2, 2026-10-06, 0d
    One-week wait (F3)                :f3, 2026-10-06, 2026-10-13
    Final QA (F4)                     :crit, f4, 2026-10-17, 1d
    Publish (F5)                      :crit, milestone, f5, 2026-10-17, 0d

    section Portfolio
    README write-up (G1)              :g1, 2026-10-13, 2026-10-21
